	(text "IMU on I2C4 (2.2k pull-ups R5/R6 on the top sheet). AP_AD0 pulled low by R217 (I2C address 0x68).\nThe IMU is leadless: probe AD0 on R217, INT2 on its pull-up R92 and FSYNC on R211. Run a wire to a spare pin if INT2 or FSYNC is needed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
